Attention Is All You Need (Vaswani et al., 2017)
Method: Uses self-attention mechanisms to process sequences in parallel.
Dataset: WMT 2014 translation datasets.
Advantages: Captures global relationships across long data sequences.
Limitations: Quadratic scaling ($O(N^2)$) creates memory bloat and latency.
Research Gap: Constant $O(1)$ memory inference for real-time game loops.
Possible Improvements: Replaces heavy Transformer attention with linear $O(N)$ Mamba processing.
